  "titleText": {
    "es": "O quizás el tobogán es como Aslan y se hace más alto conmigo (pero sin la sensación de incomodidad de llegar a la adolescencia y darse cuenta de repente de todo el rollo de Cristo).",
    "en": "Or maybe the slide is like Aslan, and gets taller as I do (except without the feeling of discomfort when I reach my teens and suddenly get the Christ stuff.)",
    "noteEn": "The title text extends the joke about perspective changing with age: it imagines Aslan changing size too, then pivots to readers recognizing Aslan's Christian symbolism when they are older."
  },
